          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "information satisfies the concepts of relevance and reliability, thereby ensuring that the substance of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          236.80032352941177,
          369.8502874109264,
          386.50994579831934,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the underlying transaction or other events is reported."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          236.80032352941177,
          395.51963509501184,
          706.8159684873949,
          11.820879453681755
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The following significant accounting policies have been adopted in the preparation and presentation"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          236.80032352941177,
          412.563059976247,
          161.35140000000004,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of the financial report:"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          463.9005136579573,
          667.94443697479,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Trade payables and other accounts payable are recognised when the economic entity becomes"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          480.9426725059383,
          591.3435512605042,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "obliged to make future payments resulting from the purchase of goods and services."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          532.2823660926366,
          667.9373911764707,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Assets acquired are recorded at the cost of acquisition, being the purchase consideration"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          549.3245249406176,
          566.7980571428573,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "determined as at the date of acquisition plus costs incidental to the acquisition."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          574.9939091448931,
          667.9339113445378,
          11.82083076009502
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In the event that settlement of all or part of the cash consideration given in the acquisition of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          592.0372975059382,
          667.9514827731094,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "an asset is deferred, the fair value of the purchase consideration is determined by discounting"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          609.0806736935867,
          605.6573058823531,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the amounts payable in the future to their present value as at the date of acquisition."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          660.4194421021377,
          667.9198369747901,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Bills of exchange are recorded at an amount equal to the net proceeds received, with the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          677.4616009501187,
          667.953274369748,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "premium or discount amortised over the period until maturity. Interest expense is recognised"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          694.5037597980997,
          187.6311941176471,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "on an effective yield basis."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          720.1731440023752,
          667.9339113445378,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Debentures, bank loans and other loans are recorded at an amount equal to the net proceeds"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          737.2165323634204,
          423.9792084033613,
          11.820855106888416
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "received. Interest expense is recognised on an accrual basis."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          762.8859043942994,
          667.9427487394959,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Ancillary costs incurred in connection with the arrangement of borrowings are deferred and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          779.9280510688836,
          317.4893915966387,
          11.820855106888388
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "amortised over the period of the borrowings."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          831.2685480997625,
          667.9198369747901,
          11.820867280285086
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "No provision has been made for capital gains tax which may arise in the event of sale of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          275.7761638655462,
          848.3119364608076,
          506.19240840336147,
          11.820867280285029
